      "text": "- Sets the directory for later RUN/COPY/CMD\n- Creates the folder if it does not exist\n- Use it instead of RUN cd (cd does not persist)\n- Relative paths stack: /app then src = /app/src",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e20",
      "originalText": "- Sets the directory for later RUN/COPY/CMD\n- Creates the folder if it does not exist\n- Use it instead of RUN cd (cd does not persist)\n- Relative paths stack: /app then src = /app/src",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aK",
      "created": null,
