      "updated": 1790677165745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Each instruction is one cached layer\n- One layer changes: every layer after it rebuilds\n- Order: rarely changing first, often changing last\n- RUN is cached by command text, not its result\n- docker history shows layers, --no-cache rebuilds",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
